OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after boy, 6, dies in
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old boy has died following a
OL,7,Fcrash, police have said.
OL,9,FNorth Wales Police said officers were
OL,10,Fcalled to reports of a collision
OL,11,Finvolving a vehicle and a child in
OL,12,FLlanfairfechan, Conwy county, at just
OL,13,Fafter 17:00 BST on Thursday evening.
OL,15,FThe child was pronounced dead at the
OL,16,Fscene.
OL,18,FA 39-year-old man has been arrested,
OL,19,Fthe force added, while the boy's family
OL,20,Fis being supported by specially trained
OL,21,Ffamily liaison officers.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
